# T-1742: Dynamic % access — next stage uses % non-statically, no abandoned-output warning.
# Even though stage 1 produces 'y' and stage 2 only accesses 'x' statically,
# the dynamic access to % suppresses the lint for this stage pair.
[x: 1  y: 2]
---
[key: "x"  result: [get $key %]]
=== out
["key": "x"  "result": 1]
